<beginRules>
<beginEffectRule>
CreateRequirementsEffectRuleA
30
CreateRequirements
0
false
true
<beginRuleAnnotation>
* Each nhân viên's energy and mood are decreased as they expend energy working

* Each nhân viên's productivity in yêu cầu is modified according to their energy level (more energy -> more productive) and the number of other actions they are involved in (more other actions -> less productive)

* Each nhân viên's lỗi rate in yêu cầu is modified according to their energy level (more energy -> less lỗi) and the number of other actions they are involved in (more other actions -> less lỗi)

* The size of the tài liệu yêu cầu is incremented by the nhân viên' productivities in yêu cầu modified by the following:
    - The number of communication links between employees in this action
    - The productivity increase factor of the requirements capture tool involved in this action (if there is one)

* The number of unknown lỗi in the tài liệu yêu cầu is incremented by the nhân viên' lỗi rates in yêu cầu modified by the following:
    - The number of communication links between employees in this action
    - The error rate decrease factor of the requirements capture tool involved in this action (if there is one)

* If the associated đoạn code is more hoàn thành than the tài liệu yêu cầu, the number of known lỗi in the code increases

* If the associated tài liệu thiết kế is more hoàn thành than the tài liệu yêu cầu, the number of known lỗi in the tài liệu thiết kế increases

* If the associated kế hoạch kiểm thử hệ thống is more hoàn thành than the tài liệu yêu cầu, the number of known lỗi in the kế hoạch kiểm thử hệ thống increases
<endRuleAnnotation>
<beginParticipantRuleEffect>
