ProductivityInRequirements
(thisSoftwareEngineer-Employee:ProductivityInRequirementsUnadjusted * thisSoftwareEngineer-Employee:Energy) / (numActiveActionsThis-Emp-SoftwareEngineer-Employee:* - 1) 
