<beginRuleAnnotation>
* Each nhân viên's energy and mood are decreased as they expend energy working

* Each nhân viên's productivity in thiết kế is modified according to their energy level (more energy -> more productive) and the number of other actions they are involved in (more other actions -> less productive)

* Each nhân viên's lỗi rate in thiết kế is modified according to their energy level (more energy -> less lỗi) and the number of other actions they are involved in (more other actions -> less lỗi)

* Decreases the number of unknown lỗi in the tài liệu thiết kế by an amount that is dependent upon the thiết kế productivity of the nhân viên participants, modified by (slowed down by) the number of communication links between nhân viên in this action. Also increments the number of known lỗi by this same amount.
<endRuleAnnotation>
