<beginRuleAnnotation>
* Each nhân viên's energy and mood are decreased as they expend energy working

* Each nhân viên's productivity in coding is modified according to their energy level (more energy -> more productive) and the number of other actions they are involved in (more other actions -> less productive)

* Each nhân viên's lỗi rate in coding is modified according to their energy level (more energy -> less lỗi) and the number of other actions they are involved in (more other actions -> less lỗi)

* The size of the code is incremented by the nhân viên' productivities in coding modified by the following:
    - The number of communication links between employees in this action
    - The productivity increase factor of the IDE tool involved in this action (if there is one)
    - The completeness of the associated requirements document compared to that of the code (more complete -> larger size increment)
    - The completeness of the associated design document compared to that of the code (more complete -> larger size increment)

* The number of unknown lỗi in the code is incremented by the nhân viên' lỗi rates in thiết kế modified by the following:
    - The number of communication links between employees in this action
    - The error rate decrease factor of the IDE tool involved in this action (if there is one)
    - The completeness of the associated requirements document compared to that of the code (more complete -> smaller error increment)
    - The completeness of the associated design document compared to that of the code (more complete -> smaller error increment)
    - The erroneousness of the requirements document (more errors -> larger error increment)
    - The erroneousness of the design document (more errors -> larger error increment)
<endRuleAnnotation>
