<beginParticipantAttributeRuleEffect>
Name

<endParticipantAttributeRuleEffect>
<beginParticipantAttributeRuleEffect>
NumUnknownErrors
thisCode-Artifact:NumUnknownErrors + (allActive-Emp-SoftwareEngineer-Employee:ErrorRateInCoding * (1 - (.01 * (num-Emp * (num-Emp - 1) / 2))) * (1 + ((allActive-AssociatedRequirementsDoc-RequirementsDocument-Artifact:PercentErroneous + allActive-AssociatedDesignDocument-DesignDocument-Artifact:PercentErroneous) / 100 * 20)) * (1 + (2 - ((.5 * thisCode-Artifact:CompletenessDiffReqDoc) + (2 * thisCode-Artifact:CompletenessDiffDesDoc)))) * (1 - allActive-DevelopmentEnvironment-IDE-Tool:ErrorRateDecreaseFactor)) 
<endParticipantAttributeRuleEffect>
<beginParticipantAttributeRuleEffect>
NumKnownErrors

<endParticipantAttributeRuleEffect>
<beginParticipantAttributeRuleEffect>
PercentIntegrated
thisCode-Artifact:AmountIntegrated / (thisCode-Artifact:Size + .1) * 100 
<endParticipantAttributeRuleEffect>
<beginParticipantAttributeRuleEffect>
Size
thisCode-Artifact:Size + (allActive-Emp-SoftwareEngineer-Employee:ProductivityInCoding * (1 - (.01 * (num-Emp * (num-Emp - 1) / 2))) * (1 + (thisCode-Artifact:CompletenessDiffDesDoc + (.5 * thisCode-Artifact:CompletenessDiffReqDoc))) * (1 + allActive-DevelopmentEnvironment-IDE-Tool:ProductivityIncreaseFactor)) 
<endParticipantAttributeRuleEffect>
<beginParticipantAttributeRuleEffect>
PercentComplete
thisCode-Artifact:Size / allActive-Proj-SEProject-Project:RequiredSizeOfCode * 100 
<endParticipantAttributeRuleEffect>
<endParticipantTypeRuleEffect>
<endParticipantRuleEffect>
<beginParticipantRuleEffect>
