<beginEffectRule>
InspectCodeEffectRuleA
22
InspectCode
0
false
true
<beginRuleAnnotation>
* Each nhân viên's energy and mood are decreased as they expend energy working

* Each nhân viên's productivity in coding is modified according to their energy level (more energy -> more productive) and the number of other actions they are involved in (more other actions -> less productive)

* Each nhân viên's lỗi rate in coding is modified according to their energy level (more energy -> less lỗi) and the number of other actions they are involved in (more other actions -> less lỗi)

* Decreases the number of unknown lỗi in the code document by an amount that is dependent upon the coding productivity of the nhân viên participants, modified by:
    - the number of communication links between employees in this action (more links -> smaller decrement / less progress)
    -  how integrated the code is (more integrated -> smaller decrement / less progress)

* The number of known lỗi in the code is also incremented by this same amount.
<endRuleAnnotation>
<beginParticipantRuleEffect>
Emp
<beginParticipantTypeRuleEffect>
1
SoftwareEngineer
None
<beginParticipantAttributeRuleEffect>
OnBreak

<endParticipantAttributeRuleEffect>
<beginParticipantAttributeRuleEffect>
TestingExperience

<endParticipantAttributeRuleEffect>
<beginParticipantAttributeRuleEffect>
ProductivityInTestingUnadjusted

<endParticipantAttributeRuleEffect>
<beginParticipantAttributeRuleEffect>
ErrorRateInTestingUnadjusted

<endParticipantAttributeRuleEffect>
<beginParticipantAttributeRuleEffect>
ProductivityInTesting

<endParticipantAttributeRuleEffect>
<beginParticipantAttributeRuleEffect>
ErrorRateInTesting

<endParticipantAttributeRuleEffect>
