<beginEffectRule>
IntegrateCodeEffectRuleA
4
IntegrateCode
0
false
true
<beginRuleAnnotation>
* Each nhân viên's energy and mood are decreased as they expend energy working

* Each nhân viên's productivity in coding is modified according to their energy level (more energy -> more productive) and the number of other actions they are involved in (more other actions -> less productive)

* Each nhân viên's lỗi rate in coding is modified according to their energy level (more energy -> less lỗi) and the number of other actions they are involved in (more other actions -> less lỗi)

* The amount of code integrated is increased by an amount dependent upon the nhân viên' coding productivity modified by:
    - the number of communication links between employees in this action (more links -> smaller increment / slower progress)
    - the number of authors involved in the development of this code (more authors -> slower progress due to a larger number of separate modules that need to be integrated)
    - how complete the associated design document is compared to the percent integrated of the code (more complete design doc -> faster progress)
    - the erroneousness of the associated design document (more errors -> slower progress)

* The number of unknown lỗi in the code is increased by an amount dependent upon the nhân viên' coding lỗi rates modified by:
    - the number of communication links between employees in this action (more links -> less unknown errors introduced / slower progress)
    - how complete the associated design document is compared to the percent integrated of the code (less complete design doc -> more errors introduced)

<endRuleAnnotation>
<beginParticipantRuleEffect>
Emp
<beginParticipantTypeRuleEffect>
1
SoftwareEngineer
None
<beginParticipantAttributeRuleEffect>
OnBreak

<endParticipantAttributeRuleEffect>
