<beginEffectRule>
SystemTestEffectRuleA
16
SystemTest
0
false
true
<beginRuleAnnotation>
* Each nhân viên's energy and mood are decreased as they expend energy working

* Each nhân viên's productivity in testing is modified according to their energy level (more energy -> more productive) and the number of other actions they are involved in (more other actions -> less productive)

* Each nhân viên's lỗi rate in testing is modified according to their energy level (more energy -> less lỗi) and the number of other actions they are involved in (more other actions -> less lỗi)

* Decreases the number of unknown lỗi in the code by an amount that is dependent upon the testing productivity of the nhân viên participants, modified by:
    - the number of communication links between employees in this action (more links -> smaller decrement / less progress)
    -  how complete the system test plan is compared to the completeness of the code (more complete -> larger decrement / more progress)
    - the erroneousness of the system test plan (more errors -> smaller decrement / less progress)
    - the productivity increase factor of the automated testing tool used in this action (if there is one)

* The number of known lỗi in the code is also incremented by this same amount.
<endRuleAnnotation>
<beginParticipantRuleEffect>
CodeDoc
<beginParticipantTypeRuleEffect>
2
