<beginEffectRule>
CreateSystemTestPlanEffectRuleA
13
CreateSystemTestPlan
0
false
true
<beginRuleAnnotation>
* Each nhân viên's energy and mood are decreased as they expend energy working

* Each nhân viên's productivity in testing is modified according to their energy level (more energy -> more productive) and the number of other actions they are involved in (more other actions -> less productive)

* Each nhân viên's lỗi rate in testing is modified according to their energy level (more energy -> less lỗi) and the number of other actions they are involved in (more other actions -> less lỗi)

* The size of the kế hoạch kiểm thử hệ thống is incremented by the nhân viên' productivities in testing modified by the following:
    - The number of communication links between employees in this action
    - The productivity increase factor of the automated testing tool involved in this action (if there is one)
    - The completeness of the associated requirements document  (more complete -> larger size increment)

* The number of unknown lỗi in the kế hoạch kiểm thử hệ thống is incremented by the nhân viên' lỗi rates in thiết kế modified by the following:
    - The number of communication links between employees in this action
    - The error rate decrease factor of the automated testing tool involved in this action (if there is one)
    - The erroneousness of the requirements document (more errors -> larger error increment)
    - The completeness of the requirements document (more complete -> less errors introduced)
<endRuleAnnotation>
<beginParticipantRuleEffect>
Emp
<beginParticipantTypeRuleEffect>
1
SoftwareEngineer
None
<beginParticipantAttributeRuleEffect>
OnBreak

<endParticipantAttributeRuleEffect>
<beginParticipantAttributeRuleEffect>
TestingExperience

<endParticipantAttributeRuleEffect>
<beginParticipantAttributeRuleEffect>
ProductivityInTestingUnadjusted

<endParticipantAttributeRuleEffect>
<beginParticipantAttributeRuleEffect>
ErrorRateInTestingUnadjusted

<endParticipantAttributeRuleEffect>
<beginParticipantAttributeRuleEffect>
ProductivityInTesting
(thisSoftwareEngineer-Employee:ProductivityInTestingUnadjusted * thisSoftwareEngineer-Employee:Energy) / (numActiveActionsThis-Emp-SoftwareEngineer-Employee:* - 1) 
<endParticipantAttributeRuleEffect>
<beginParticipantAttributeRuleEffect>
ErrorRateInTesting
(thisSoftwareEngineer-Employee:ErrorRateInTestingUnadjusted * (1 + 1 - thisSoftwareEngineer-Employee:Energy)) / (numActiveActionsThis-Emp-SoftwareEngineer-Employee:* - 1) 
<endParticipantAttributeRuleEffect>
<beginParticipantAttributeRuleEffect>
