<beginEffectRule>
CorrectTestPlanEffectRuleA
-1
CorrectSystemTestPlan
0
false
true
<beginRuleAnnotation>
* Each nhân viên's energy and mood are decreased as they expend energy working

* Each nhân viên's productivity in testing is modified according to their energy level (more energy -> more productive) and the number of other actions they are involved in (more other actions -> less productive)

* Each nhân viên's lỗi rate in testing is modified according to their energy level (more energy -> less lỗi) and the number of other actions they are involved in (more other actions -> less lỗi)

* The number of known lỗi in the kế hoạch kiểm thử hệ thống is decreased by an amount dependent upon the nhân viên' testing productivity modified by:
    - the number of communication links between employees in this action (more links -> smaller decrement / slower progress)
    - the productivity increase factor of the automated testing tool in this action, if there is one

* The number of unknown lỗi in the kế hoạch kiểm thử hệ thống is increased by an amount dependent upon the nhân viên' testing lỗi rates modified by:
    - the number of communication links between employees in this action (more links -> less unknown errors introduced / slower progress)
    - the error rate decrease factor of the automated testing tool in this action, if there is one
<endRuleAnnotation>
<beginParticipantRuleEffect>
Emp
<beginParticipantTypeRuleEffect>
1
SoftwareEngineer
None
<beginParticipantAttributeRuleEffect>
OnBreak

<endParticipantAttributeRuleEffect>
