<endParticipantAttributeRuleEffect>
<beginParticipantAttributeRuleEffect>
NumUnknownErrors
thisSystemTestPlan-Artifact:NumUnknownErrors + ((.2 * allActive-Emp-SoftwareEngineer-Employee:ErrorRateInTesting) * (1 - (.01 * (num-Emp * (num-Emp - 1) / 2))) * (1 - allActive-TestingTool-AutomatedTestingTool-Tool:ErrorRateDecreaseFactor)) 
<endParticipantAttributeRuleEffect>
<beginParticipantAttributeRuleEffect>
PercentErroneous
(thisSystemTestPlan-Artifact:NumKnownErrors + thisSystemTestPlan-Artifact:NumUnknownErrors) / (thisSystemTestPlan-Artifact:Size + .1) * 100 
