<beginRuleAnnotation>
Calculates the điểm for the game based on how hoàn thành the code is (more hoàn thành -> higher điểm), how correct it is (fewer lỗi -> higher điểm), how integrated it is (more integrated -> higher điểm), how well the ngân sách was adhered to (under or at ngân sách -> higher điểm, the more over ngân sách you are -> lower điểm), and how well the tiến độ was adhered to (under or on time -> higher điểm, the more over time you are -> lower điểm)
<endRuleAnnotation>
