<beginEffectRule>
ChangePayRateEffectRuleA
10
ChangePayRate
1
false
true
<beginRuleAnnotation>
Either increases or decreases the nhân viên's energy and mood by an amount that is proportional to the magnitude of the pay increase/decrease compared to their previous pay rate (larger pay increase/decrease -> larger energy and mood increment/decrement)

Permanently modifes the nhân viên's productivity in all areas by an amount that is proportional to the magnitude of the pay increase/decrease compared to their previous pay rate (larger pay increase/decrease -> larger productivity increment/decrement)

Permanently modifes the nhân viên's lỗi rate in all areas by an amount that is proportional to the magnitude of the pay increase/decrease compared to their previous pay rate (larger pay increase/decrease -> larger lỗi rate increment/decrement)
<endRuleAnnotation>
<beginParticipantRuleEffect>
Emp
<beginParticipantTypeRuleEffect>
1
SoftwareEngineer
None
<beginParticipantAttributeRuleEffect>
OnBreak

<endParticipantAttributeRuleEffect>
<beginParticipantAttributeRuleEffect>
TestingExperience

<endParticipantAttributeRuleEffect>
<beginParticipantAttributeRuleEffect>
ProductivityInTestingUnadjusted
thisSoftwareEngineer-Employee:ProductivityInTestingUnadjusted + ((thisSoftwareEngineer-Employee:ProductivityInTestingUnadjusted * ((input-NewPayRate - thisSoftwareEngineer-Employee:PayRate) / thisSoftwareEngineer-Employee:PayRate)) / 2) 
<endParticipantAttributeRuleEffect>
<beginParticipantAttributeRuleEffect>
ErrorRateInTestingUnadjusted
thisSoftwareEngineer-Employee:ErrorRateInTestingUnadjusted - ((thisSoftwareEngineer-Employee:ErrorRateInTestingUnadjusted * ((input-NewPayRate - thisSoftwareEngineer-Employee:PayRate) / thisSoftwareEngineer-Employee:PayRate)) / 2) 
<endParticipantAttributeRuleEffect>
