<beginEffectRule>
GiveBonusEffectRuleA
4
GiveBonus
1
false
true
<beginRuleAnnotation>
Increases the nhân viên's mood and energy by an amount that is proportional to the amount of the bonus compared to the nhân viên's pay rate (larger bonus -> more energy and mood increase).

This has the effect of temporarily increasing the nhân viên's productivity in all areas, and decreasing their lỗi rates in all areas.

Also subtracts the bonus amount from the dự án ngân sách
<endRuleAnnotation>
